{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>WonderLang French</strong>, where mastering French becomes an <strong>engaging RPG journey</strong>. Immerse yourself in captivating quests, interactive dialogues, and fun puzzles <strong>designed to make language learning seamless and enjoyable</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This page is for the <strong>French-learning version</strong> of WonderLang.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn French from the following base (starting) languages: English, French, Spanish, German, Italian, Portuguese, Korean, Chinese, Japanese, Dutch, Indonesian, Polish, Russian, Ukrainian, and Arabic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other WonderLang versions are also available so you can learn <strong>French, Spanish, German, Portuguese, Italian, Korean, and Japanese</strong>, with <strong>Chinese coming December 2025</strong> and <strong>English January 2026</strong>. There is also a <strong>WonderLang Polyglot</strong> edition that gives you access to <strong>all languages, including future releases</strong> in a single purchase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the Demo directly in your browser (no install) on our website: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderLang weaves language into the core of its adventure and narrative. Get immersed in WonderLang as you <strong>Explore</strong>, <strong>Fight</strong>, <strong>Converse</strong>, and <strong>Investigate</strong> using your <strong>target language</strong>. Every quest and interaction becomes meaningful practice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More affordable</strong>, <strong>more engaging</strong>, and <strong>way more fun</strong> than any subscription-based <strong>language learning app</strong>!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras/54ca8ef42134991cf18b18b054ee353d.avif?t=1765894484\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras_big/54ca8ef42134991cf18b18b054ee353d.avif?t=1765894484 width=800 height=221 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderLang is designed for <strong>beginner language learners</strong>, allowing you to dive into the game without any prior knowledge of French. While the game does not aim to fully replace traditional language courses, it provides an <strong>immersive and enjoyable way to practice</strong> a new language gradually as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive French Learning</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn practical French through every conversation, quest, and puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 45 hours</strong> of combined learning and gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Modes</strong> to adapt the difficulty for <strong>very beginners, A1 and A2 level</strong> learners.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">                                                              <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras/75d0459a948d54e66fb02c8ff1cc257c.apng?t=1765894484\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras/75d0459a948d54e66fb02c8ff1cc257c.poster.avif?t=1765894484\" class=\"bb_img\" width=73 height=107 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Storyline</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the journey of a young hero who must learn French to lift a magical curse from their brother.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vibrant villages, uncover secrets, and build friendships by interacting with over <strong>60 unique NPCs</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras/91eb45cdbf2905c57aea71a7aea529e5.avif?t=1765894484\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras_big/91eb45cdbf2905c57aea71a7aea529e5.avif?t=1765894484 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learning as a Gameplay Mechanic</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and complete quests by forming sentences and understanding dialogues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice building sentences and pronunciation with <strong>speech recognition challenges</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use in-game tools such as a <strong>dictionary</strong> and <strong>contextual help</strong> to support your learning.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">                                                         <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras/6e46f68cb2492ee721f0862c735137dd.poster.avif?t=1765894484\" width=74 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras/6e46f68cb2492ee721f0862c735137dd.webm?t=1765894484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spaced Repetition Combat Challenges</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>language-based combat</strong> to reinforce vocabulary and grammar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat challenges are designed using the <strong>spaced repetition principle</strong> to boost long-term retention.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras/d7f61f1bd28f1c79136bfcafa8dd3171.avif?t=1765894484\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras_big/d7f61f1bd28f1c79136bfcafa8dd3171.avif?t=1765894484 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-World Context Practice</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply your French skills in <strong>everyday scenarios</strong> such as buying groceries or making a doctor\u2019s appointment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience practical vocabulary and grammar in <strong>real-world contexts</strong> to enhance your confidence and proficiency.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">                                                     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras/b9e13f2969f444e4174b8735c86f02fc.poster.avif?t=1765894484\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras/b9e13f2969f444e4174b8735c86f02fc.webm?t=1765894484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Learning Experience</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your learning journey with difficulty settings that make the experience more relaxed or more challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set <strong>daily goals</strong> and earn rewards for reaching them, helping you build a consistent learning routine.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras/388a122f3327cf08ed38a6e3c25051df.avif?t=1765894484\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras_big/388a122f3327cf08ed38a6e3c25051df.avif?t=1765894484 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Interactive World</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore exotic locations</strong>, each introducing specific French vocabulary and grammar patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in <strong>mini-games</strong> like crosswords, memory games, and charades to diversify your learning experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras/347390bf861aacbbd7ee3836ea784c98.avif?t=1765894484\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras_big/347390bf861aacbbd7ee3836ea784c98.avif?t=1765894484 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WonderLang can be played with a mouse and keyboard, mouse only, or keyboard only.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It also plays great on the Steam Deck with an official control layout.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the Demo directly in your browser (no install) on our website: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">                                                 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras/ccdf73f1ea974747a06efb92cb695755.apng?t=1765894484\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras/ccdf73f1ea974747a06efb92cb695755.poster.avif?t=1765894484\" class=\"bb_img\" width=89 height=90 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras/939ca7fb7c6ef58353da17d0ff77dd07.apng?t=1765894484\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras/939ca7fb7c6ef58353da17d0ff77dd07.poster.avif?t=1765894484\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=98 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3035140?t=1765894484","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3035140?t=1765894484","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/5350920d866834020559001c859efd6ea3b375d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765894484","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/5350920d866834020559001c859efd6ea3b375d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765894484","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4072660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>WonderLang French</strong>, where mastering French becomes an <strong>engaging RPG journey</strong>. Immerse yourself in captivating quests, interactive dialogues, and fun puzzles <strong>designed to make language learning seamless and enjoyable</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This page is for the <strong>French-learning version</strong> of WonderLang.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn French from the following base (starting) langua