ts/steam/apps/3035140/extras_big/91eb45cdbf2905c57aea71a7aea529e5.avif?t=1765894484 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learning as a Gameplay Mechanic</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and complete quests by forming sentences and understanding dialogues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice building sentences and pronunciation with <strong>speech recognition challenges</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use in-game tools such as a <strong>dictionary</strong> and <strong>contextual help</strong> to support your learning.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">                                                         <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras/6e46f68cb2492ee721f0862c735137dd.poster.avif?t=1765894484\" width=74 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras/6e46f68cb2492ee721f0862c735137dd.webm?t=1765894484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spaced Repetition Combat Challenges</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>language-based combat</strong> to reinforce vocabulary and grammar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat challenges are designed using the <strong>spaced repetition principle</strong> to boost long-term retention.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras/d7f61f1bd28f1c79136bfcafa8dd3171.avif?t=1765894484\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035140/extras_big/d